  "summary": "LS5 454 big-block front accessory drive: generator (alternator) [2] with its fan [3] and pulley [4], lower mounting bracket [5] and upper adjusting brace [1], crankshaft pulley [8], water pump pulley [11], fan clutch [12] and the two drive belts [6]/[7]. The bracket bolts to the engine with bolts [18] and lock washers [17]; a long bolt [20] passes through the bracket, generator ear, spacer [19] and washers [15] into nut [16]; the brace is bolted to the engine with [18]/[17] and to the generator with a production bolt. The crank pulley is held by bolt [10] and special washer [9]; the fan clutch bolts to the pump pulley with bolts [13].",
